		"project": "crosstech.ke",
		"url": "https://crosstech.ke",
		"repo": "Private",
		"descriptionTitle": "A complete e-commerce system for Crosstech",
		"description": "I developed a full-featured e-commerce system for Crosstech that streamlines both online and retail operations in Kenya. The platform integrates affiliate management, a robust POS system, inventory and order management, user management with role-based access, and seamless M-Pesa payment processing. It also supports real-time notifications, SMS updates, and is designed to scale with a mobile app coming soon. Built using Laravel, React, MySQL, and RESTful APIs, with integrations for M-Pesa Daraja API and SMS gateways, the system is engineered for performance, scalability, and reliability. Designed to compete with established platforms like Jumia, this solution positions Crosstech as a reliable and innovative marketplace for businesses and customers in Kenya.",
